**`RESEARCH_PAPER.md`** (about 4,250 words) and **`RESEARCH_PAPER.tex`** (an `amsart` version with the same theorems, slightly condensed) cover:
- the residual decomposition and ceiling theorem, with the equality case and the remaining headroom;
- the binary-data floor \(\mathrm{SSW}=n\sum \bar y_N(1-\bar y_N)\);
